// Computes a canonical content hash of the already-normalized resume
// text, so CANDOR-08 can later detect "the same resume submitted again"
// independent of filename, candidate_id (always freshly minted), or
// trivial re-encoding/whitespace differences.
//
// Canonicalization is applied ON TOP of NormalizeText's own mojibake
