// ARCHITECTURAL DECISION (stated explicitly, per the build instruction):
// this node builds the full CANDOR-01-shaped "verified candidate
// record" DIRECTLY from the form's own structured fields and calls
// CANDOR-04 directly (CallCANDOR04FromApplicationForm) - it does NOT
// call CANDOR-01's workflow, and no Anthropic extraction call is made
// anywhere on this path. CANDOR-01/CANDOR-04 are both completely
// unmodified by this adapter.
